<title>USA: HIG Investment Group to buy Thermal Industries.</title>
<headline>HIG Investment Group to buy Thermal Industries.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thermal Industries Inc and HIG Investment Group LP have announced that it and affiliates of HIG have entered into a definitive merger agreement which provides for a wholly owned subsidiary of HIG to buy Thermal.</p>
<p>The agreement provides for the shareholders of Thermal to receive $15 per share in cash, a statement issued by the two concerns on Monday said.</p>
<p>The transaction is valued at about $29.6 million, the statement added.</p>
</text>
